<title>HONG KONG: Fong's Ind posts deeper loss in interim.</title>
<headline>Fong's Ind posts deeper loss in interim.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.54 loss vs 1.42 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  9.24 loss vs 2.64 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    9.30 loss vs 5.23 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     238.01    vs 372.33</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fong's Industries Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Fong's Industries makes dyeing and drying machines.</p>
<p>Exceptional loss represents loss on sale of investment properties and redundancy payments to workers in Hong Kong who were laid off during the period resulting from the transfer of the company's productions facilities to China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
